    "searchNote": {
      "en": "Multiple search terms are combined with AND logic. Use quotes for phrases, e.g. \"sunset beach\".\n\nGeneration info*: For images generated by ComfyUI, this refers to the text content extracted from the workflow and API prompt, with numerical parameters removed; for images generated by A1111 webui, this refers to the complete parameters used for generation.",
      "cn": "多个搜索词将使用“与”的逻辑组合。使用引号表示短语，例如 \"sunset beach\"。\n\n生成信息*：对于 ComfyUI 生成的图像，指的是从 workflow 和 API prompt 中提取出来的文本内容，其中的数字参数会被去除；对于 A1111 webui 生成的图像，指的是生成图像的完整参数"
    },
    "syntaxTable": {
      "cat": {
